WEBVTT

00:00:01.321 --> 00:00:04.119
Every year, more of the market runs on AI.

00:00:04.169 --> 00:00:06.419
And it's starting to think alike.

00:00:07.719 --> 00:00:10.444
When it moves together, markets panic.

00:00:12.165 --> 00:00:13.465
We don't.

00:00:15.653 --> 00:00:18.078
QUARCC Purple is market neutral.

00:00:20.009 --> 00:00:23.234
Long the strongest companies, short the weakest.

00:00:26.169 --> 00:00:30.127
Seven AI agents work alongside us, on our own machines.

00:00:30.177 --> 00:00:35.577
They read thousands of filings, challenge every idea, and check every number.

00:00:36.103 --> 00:00:40.504
We even built 60 AI investors to study how machines trade.

00:00:40.554 --> 00:00:42.729
Thirty of them think like four.

00:00:43.625 --> 00:00:47.825
Across 17 replayed crises, our book barely moved.

00:00:51.741 --> 00:00:53.453
AI will move markets.

00:00:53.503 --> 00:00:56.703
We built the fund that stays level when it does.

00:00:57.148 --> 00:00:58.412
QUARCC Purple.

00:00:58.462 --> 00:01:00.237
Calm, by design.
